{
  "kit_version": "1.28.0",
  "steps": [
    {
      "caption": "接入一个仓库：一条命令，拿到门禁与产物规范",
      "cmd": "devflow init --name demo",
      "lines": [
        "devflow init  项目：demo",
        "  技术栈：未识别（未套用适配器，保留占位脚本）　提示：devflow adapters 可查看支持的栈，或用 --stack 显式指定",
        "  新建：.devflow/items/、.devflow/.local/、scripts/、.gitignore（追加 devflow 规则）、scripts/build.sh、scripts/build-should-fail.sh、scripts/test.sh、scripts/test-should-fail.sh",
        "  跳过：devflow.json（已存在，未覆盖；需要覆盖请加 --force）"
      ],
      "state": "draft",
      "gates": []
    },
    {
      "caption": "建一个变更：只需要一句话和档位",
      "cmd": "devflow new --slug first --tier micro --title '第一个变更'",
      "lines": [
        "  状态：.devflow/.local/items/2026-10-21-first（本机，已 gitignore）",
        "  生成骨架：无（微档不留文档）",
        "提示：微档只留状态记录，不需要写文档。下一步：devflow gate run <item>",
        "      微档可直接推进到 released（或只跑门禁即算完成）。"
      ],
      "state": "draft",
      "gates": []
    },
    {
      "caption": "门禁跑一遍：交付条件不满足，直接 BLOCKED",
      "cmd": "devflow gate run 2026-10-21-first",
      "lines": [
        "    ✓                            G0",
